00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,860
听：Happy Marriage Needs Fighting For.

2
00:00:02,860 --> 00:00:05,720
跟读：Happy Marriage Needs Fighting For.

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:29,259
听：As a talented navy officer, he was bound to be busy. When his wife rang him up to say that she wanted a divorce, he was still scanning a digital counter to check the data so as to give an assessment of the theoretical framework for a biochemical weapon. His junior staff’s sympathy made him feel embarrassed.

4
