5
00:00:52,797 --> 00:01:10,831
听：His wife was a part-time clerk. With his high bonus, she lived in a grand house with elegant cushions and bedding. Her favourite pastime was reading stars’ biographies or absurd fiction with endless chapters in her armchair.

6
00:01:10,831 --> 00:01:28,865
跟读：His wife was a part-time clerk. With his high bonus, she lived in a grand house with elegant cushions and bedding. Her favourite pastime was reading stars’ biographies or absurd fiction with endless chapters in her armchair.

7
00:01:28,865 --> 00:01:47,513
听：People envied her leisurely life very much. But in fact, she was tired of being left alone. She sent emails to his mailbox every week to state her thinking and ask for his accompaniment, but never received a satisfactory reply.

8
00:01:47,513 --> 00:02:06,161
